WEBVTT

00:02:27.496 --> 00:02:31.996
with energy-dense foods and carbs, 
causing you to crave comfort foods.

00:02:32.288 --> 00:02:35.746
High levels of cortisol can also cause you
to put on those extra calories

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:37.871
as visceral or deep belly fat.

00:02:37.913 --> 00:02:41.663
This type of fat doesn’t just make it 
harder to button your pants.

00:02:42.954 --> 00:02:45.579
It is an organ that actively
releases hormones

00:02:45.621 --> 00:02:49.329
and immune system chemicals
called “cytokines”

00:02:49.371 --> 00:02:52.204
that can increase your risk 
of developing chronic diseases,

00:02:52.246 --> 00:02:56.246
such as heart disease 
and insulin resistance.

00:02:56.538 --> 00:03:00.496
Meanwhile, stress hormones affect 
immune cells in a variety of ways.